eligibility.criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age 18 years or older;
* Previous sleeve gastrectomy for the treatment of obesity;
* Follow-up at the HCRP gastrosurgery/bariatric surgery outpatient clinic through 2026;
* Clinical evaluation supporting revisional conversion to intestinal transit bipartition;
* Willingness to undergo the new surgical procedure and provide written informed consent.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Liver cirrhosis;
* Absence of willingness to undergo a new surgical procedure.
